!README.md
# The developer's own exported weights. `svipall-models`'s build script embeds whatever is in this
# directory, so without this line a `slim` image built on a machine that has them ships 58 MB of
# ONNX it has no `onnx-*` feature to read, and a `full` image is only reproducible on machines that
# happen to have run the export. The `full` stage runs tools/models/export.py itself.
crates/svipall-models/models/*.onnx
crates/svipall-models/models/*.json
